                <pb facs="0650" n="620" xml:id="pg620"/>

                <head>320. National Security Council Report<anchor n="1" xml:id="d320-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1955-02-28"><hi rendition="#italic">February 28,
                        1955</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>NSC 5510/1</p>
                <p rendition="#center">NOTE BY THE EXECUTIVE SECRETARY TO THE NATIONAL SECURITY
                    COUNCIL</p>
                <p>The National Security Council, the Secretary of the Treasury, and the Director,
                    Bureau of the Budget, at the 238th Council meeting on February 24, 1955,<anchor
                        n="2" xml:id="d320-f2"/> adopted the statement of policy on the subject
                    contained in NSC 5510, subject to the amendments thereto which are set forth in
                    NSC Action No. 1338–b.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d320-f3"/></p>
                <p>The President has this date approved the statement of policy in NSC 5510, as
                    amended and adopted by the Council and enclosed herewith as NSC 5510/1, directs
                    its implementation by all appropriate executive departments and agencies of the
                    US Government, and designates the Operations Coordinating Board as the
                    coordinating agency.</p>
                <p>The enclosed statement of policy, as adopted and approved, supersedes NSC 36/2
                    and NSC 109.<anchor n="4" xml:id="d320-f4"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold">James S. Lay, Jr.</hi></signed><anchor n="5"
                        xml:id="d320-f5"/></closer>


                <xi:include href="d320-a1.xml" xpointer="d320-a1"/>
